expected = "The finished network embeds the proposing kernel in paxd on chain 125; a receipt is final once its block commits. Brief facts 1-3 retire the separate daemon/sequencer and unified LayerX interface and require the current public node RPC names and paths."
proposal = "Rewrite docs/readme/README.pt-BR.md introduction, component table, build/run examples and architecture diagram from the merged paxd deployment. Show the embedded kernel, commit finality and current hosted gateway/node boundaries; remove separate layerxd launch and checkpoint-settlement instructions, keeping historical context explicitly labelled."
